  "note": "All eighty-four complete first-phase floorplate sheets cover residential Towers A, B and C and office Tower D. The packet supplies each tower’s ground, selected podium levels, levels 1–15 and roof. Tower C starts at podium 2 and Tower D at podium 4. Their omitted podium drawings remain unavailable. Whole-home and office saleable totals and separate detailed unit-type sheets are absent. Confirm unit-specific areas, final layout, bridge access and the applicable source revision with Imtiaz.",
