    "Configuration areas include balconies and differ from rounded launch sizes. Tower D sheets print dimensions, not saleable totals; residential drawings were not retrieved.": "Configuration areas include balconies and differ from rounded launch sizes. Tower D sheets show room dimensions. Complete A–D floorplate drawings are available in the floor-plan section. Detailed saleable areas for each numbered home remain unverified."
